.resources/TASK-260830-2xt6fd/TASK-260830-2xt6fd_resume-rev1.md:16:STEP 5: STORY-FINAL REGISTRY. Update `internal/traceability/ownership.v0.7.0.json` for all three leaves (2bnr39, 3m7m7w, 2xt6fd). Every acceptance case must appear in its clause list; decode the registry and prove it. Re-derive `reviewedOwnershipCanonicalSHA256`, run tracecheck and the section-scoped runs, and keep the README coverage pin equal to tracecheck. MERGE every trunk registry row: two other Stories landed rows since your base. The trunk base is the new trunk, not a Story checkpoint.
