.resources/TASK-260830-2xt6fd/TASK-260830-2xt6fd_resume-rev1.md:18:PROCESS. Read the `go-testing-tools` skill first. Build the importer outcome grid keyed `(package, entry, input)`, base vs candidate, and name the moved classes. Run `GOOS=windows GOARCH=amd64 go vet ./...`, the harness and the full configured suite. Keep the evidence tar under 1 MiB. SCRATCH RULE: use the worktree's `.temp/TASK-260830-2xt6fd/` or `t.TempDir()`, never `/tmp`. LIVE-INDEX RULE: write the real index only through the tool and the handoff. Keep the checklist current, then run `task-board handoff TASK-260830-2xt6fd --role developer`. Hand off within 4 hours. Canonical CLI: /Users/iv/.curator/global/bin/task-board. Model: gpt-6-luna max. Reviewer: claude-opus-5-5 low.
